stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ABSENT

    ABSENT --> CREATED: POST /v1/sessions
    CREATED --> CLAIMED: POST /claim\nJoin Token valid
    CLAIMED --> OFFER_READY: PUT /offer\nSender Token valid
    OFFER_READY --> ANSWER_READY: PUT /answer\nReceiver Token valid

    CREATED --> CLOSED: DELETE
    CLAIMED --> CLOSED: DELETE
    OFFER_READY --> CLOSED: DELETE
    ANSWER_READY --> CLOSED: DELETE

    CREATED --> EXPIRED: Alarm at expiresAt
    CLAIMED --> EXPIRED: Alarm at expiresAt
    OFFER_READY --> EXPIRED: Alarm at expiresAt
    ANSWER_READY --> EXPIRED: Alarm at expiresAt

    CLOSED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]

    note right of CREATED
      Receiver polls Offer.
      Polling does not extend TTL.
    end note

    note right of OFFER_READY
      Receiver sets remote offer,
      creates/gathers Answer,
      then PUTs Answer.
    end note

    note right of ANSWER_READY
      Sender polls Answer and
      sets remote description.
      Signaling can then be deleted.
    end note
